    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκύκλιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who has not gone the
				round</i> of studies, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκύκλιος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				227
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκύκλωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>not surrounded</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tz.
				<u>H.</u>
				8.596
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκυλαῖον</span></b> , τό, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκυλος</span>
			, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκυλεής:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀετός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
